OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after suspect escapes
OL,4,Acustody at hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a suspect
OL,7,Fescaped custody at a hospital in
OL,8,FNottingham.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said the suspect
OL,11,F"escaped lawful custody" at the Queen's
OL,12,FMedical Centre just before 14:30 BST on
OL,13,FMonday.
OL,15,FThe man, who is not considered
OL,16,Fdangerous, had been detained earlier on
OL,17,FMonday after failing to appear in court
OL,18,Fover a shop theft, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
