OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after suspect escapes
OL,4,Acustody at hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was found in the hospital a short
OL,7,Ftime later and arrested, with
OL,8,FNottingham University Hospitals NHS
OL,9,FTrust - which runs the hospital -
OL,10,Fadding some patients "were temporarily
OL,11,Fevaucated" from the emergency
OL,12,Fdepartment as a result.
